desc: Sort lines and remove duplicates
category: ex
par: 7
hint1: Ex commands can sort
hint2: :sort has a flag that removes duplicates in one shot
solution: :sor u<CR>
note: :sort with the u flag sorts all lines and drops duplicates in one pass.
